{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"7f908e30eabbc823375589ff0d1328436fb104b8bea9f23bd33abceffda92c9e","slug":"preflight","location":"/guide/phase-4/preflight.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Book Preflight","label":"lancarbon-phase4-preflight","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Haojie Dai","given":"Haojie","family":"Dai"},"name":"Haojie Dai","id":"contributors-Users\\HAOJIE~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\lancarbon-pages-build-6WYntt\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/Hao-jieDai/LanCarbon-Guide","keywords":["LanCarbon","Jupyter Book","MyST","Markdown"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"preflight.md","url":"/LanCarbon-Guide/build/preflight-73432c64a724e2c97cc536db25df609a.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Run the check","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"APoBpDTFdY"}],"identifier":"run-the-check","label":"Run the check","html_id":"run-the-check","implicit":true,"key":"GPBTipAvqE"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Open a Book and choose Build. LanCarbon checks every page before it starts Jupyter Book. The panel groups errors and warnings and shows the page and line when available. Select a located issue to open that page in Edit.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"xGzrLD8U5R"}],"key":"PEB2MphgZc"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Errors block Build. They include invalid or duplicate export paths, missing pages, unsupported Notebook pages, malformed YAML frontmatter, duplicate or unresolved common cross-references, missing citation keys, and missing or damaged managed resources. Warnings identify empty pages, a missing Book author, or other items that can still produce a website.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"TyHloxdCn1"}],"key":"K8p379DZu3"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The preflight is intentionally conservative. The official strict Jupyter Book build remains the final syntax check and can report MyST features that the local checker does not interpret.","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"JNl3zNUbEJ"}],"key":"d7qav3CDe8"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"运行检查","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"Kw2oL8urMS"}],"identifier":"id","label":"运行检查","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"Ci3IJWKEuL"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"打开一本 Book 并点击 Build。LanCarbon 会在启动 Jupyter Book 前检查全部页面。面板按错误和警告显示结果；能够定位时会显示页面与行号，点击该项可在 Edit 中打开对应页面。","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"HnOHFg5mS6"}],"key":"IEaubrTZIP"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"错误会阻止 Build，包括无效或重复导出路径、页面缺失、尚不支持的 Notebook 页面、YAML frontmatter 格式错误、常见交叉引用重复或无法解析、引用键缺失，以及受管理资源缺失或损坏。警告包括空页面、未填写 Book 作者等仍可生成网站的项目。","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"WuhtqZxs45"}],"key":"tkDZoxJGOZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"预检采用谨慎规则，最终语法结果仍以官方 Jupyter Book 严格构建为准；CLI 可能发现本地检查器未解释的 MyST 功能。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"iFqBakzDLB"}],"key":"La1XDJBw31"}],"key":"oRS3bkw1Y1"}],"key":"xWKkAmnQ32"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Phase 4 Reference","url":"/index-5","group":"LanCarbon Guide"},"next":{"title":"Build and Saved Website","url":"/build","group":"LanCarbon Guide"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}